    "fullSolution": "**Evaluate:** $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin(3x)}{2x}$\\n\\n**Check form:** $\\frac{\\sin(0)}{0} = \\frac{0}{0}$ ✓ (indeterminate)\\n\\n**Apply L'Hôpital's rule:**\\n$$\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin(3x)}{2x} = \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\frac{d}{dx}[\\sin(3x)]}{\\frac{d}{dx}[2x]} = \\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{3\\cos(3x)}{2}$$\\n\\n**Evaluate:**\\n$$= \\frac{3\\cos(0)}{2} = \\frac{3(1)}{2} = \\frac{3}{2}$$\\n\\n**Answer: $\\frac{3}{2}$**",
